Mamba / mamba-ssm
-----------------

Upstream project: Mamba
Source: https://github.com/state-spaces/mamba
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0

PepMamba depends on the upstream mamba-ssm implementation. The bundled
mamba3_bio.py is a modified BioMamba adaptation derived from the Mamba
implementation for protein¨Cpeptide sequence modeling.

Applicable upstream copyright and attribution notices are retained in the
source file. mamba3_bio.py contains modifications made for PepMamba and is
not presented as an unmodified upstream Mamba file.

Redistribution must comply with the Apache License 2.0, including preservation
