Other dependencies and data
---------------------------

PepMamba also depends on PyTorch, causal-conv1d, Triton, ESM, and the packages
listed in requirements.txt. These dependencies are not redistributed in this
repository and remain subject to their respective upstream licenses.

Benchmark datasets, generated ESM-2 embeddings, pretrained weights, and release
checkpoints may also be subject to their respective source-specific terms.